{%- comment -%}
  Editor-only banner that flags content which MUST be replaced with true,
  verifiable material before the page runs live traffic.

  It renders ONLY inside the Shopify theme editor (request.design_mode),
  so live visitors never see it. Use it to guard: founder story, the
  worked-trade example, testimonials, and the "most traders lose" stat source.

  Accepts:
  - message {String} What must be replaced and why (required)

  Usage:
  {% render 'placeholder-note', message: 'Replace with a TRUE, attributed customer quote. Fabricated reviews are illegal under the UK DMCC Act 2024.' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="ascend-editor-note" role="note">
    <strong class="ascend-editor-note__tag">PLACEHOLDER — replace before launch</strong>
    <span class="ascend-editor-note__body">{{ message | escape }}</span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
